## 4. Best Practices for Mod Translation & Dialogue Editing

1. **Always Audit After Translating:** Run `game-dialogue-tool cross-reference` to ensure no translator accidentally modified XML string IDs (e.g. translating `<string id="esc_trader_hello">` into `<string id="esc_trader_привет">`).
2. **Preserve Color Blocks:** Ensure all `%c[color]` tags are closed with `%c[default]`.
3. **Enforce `complex_mode="1"`:** Every `<text>` tag in `talk.xml` and `talk_16.xml` must have `complex_mode="1"` enabled to allow word-wrapping.
4. **Widescreen Parity:** Never edit `talk.xml` without updating `talk_16.xml`.
